@startuml
title Player profile management
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Administrator opens Players;
if (Action?) then (create or edit)
  :Validate and normalize name,\nbirthdate, gender, and address;
  if (Invalid, duplicate, or archived profile being edited?) then (yes)
    :Reject;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Create or update player profile;
  endif
else (archive or restore)
  :Update archive flag, actor, and timestamp;
endif
:Commit and refresh affected queries;
stop
legend bottom
  Duplicate identity uses name and birthdate.
  Archiving preserves roster links; archived profiles
  do not count for readiness or player availability.
endlegend
@enduml
